From: Demo Solution Team <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] sm: retain failed teardown and retry new-install preparation

Port replacement/reprepare invariants to mainline startup adoption.
Failed stop/release keeps the instance, network, durable row and image.
Retry preparation only for the same new-install version, not while
an older failed replacement still owns the instance.

Upstream-Status: Pending [native regression proof; mainline migration]
Base: aos_core_lib_cpp 5560291ba6914e36a5b841ade4d8fc54134a9e91

